{
  "bookId": "hero-211003",
  "id": "bond-29326",
  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "29326001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "杰斯",
          "text": "莉莉奈呢？！她在这房子里吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29326002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "她不在，这房子是送你的。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29326003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "杰斯",
          "text": "莉莉奈当然要和哥哥住一起，让她也搬进来！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29326004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "我想她大概不会接受这个提议......",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29326005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "杰斯",
          "text": "谁允许你猜测莉莉奈的想法了？能看透莉莉奈心思的只有我！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29326006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "杰斯",
          "text": "我们兄妹间的感情是外人不可企及的，明白了吗！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29326007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "说实话不太明白。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29326008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "杰斯",
          "text": "呵，难怪！\n没有莉莉奈那样可爱的妹妹，你根本无法理解这种感情。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29326009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "杰斯",
          "text": "好吧，为了让你理解莉莉奈究竟多完美......\n仅此一次，我破例允许你妄想一秒——莉莉奈是你的妹妹！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29326010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "杰斯",
          "text": "停！到此为止！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29326011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "然后呢？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29326012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "杰斯",
          "text": "吼——！！！\n坏掉吧坏掉吧——坏掉吧！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29326013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "忽然这是怎么了......",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29326014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "杰斯",
          "text": "果然不能把莉莉奈分给别人，一秒都不行！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
